OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum protester who threw bottle
OL,4,Aat police jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn anti-asylum seeker protester who
OL,7,Fthrew a beer bottle at a police van has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed for two years and 11
OL,9,Fmonths.
OL,11,FKeith Silk, 34, armed himself with eggs
OL,12,Fand the bottle before attending the
OL,13,Fdemonstration in Epping, Essex, with
OL,14,Fhis parents on 17 July 2025.
OL,16,FUp to 500 people gathered outside The
OL,17,FBell Hotel after a migrant living
OL,18,Fthere, Hadush Kebatu, was charged with
OL,19,F` and later jailed for ` sex offences.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
