OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum protester who threw bottle
OL,4,Aat police jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSilk, of Torrington Drive, Loughton,
OL,7,Fwas sentenced at Chelmsford Crown
OL,8,FCourt, having been found guilty of
OL,9,Fviolent disorder and criminal damage.
